sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant W as Web
    participant D as Database
    U->>W: Sign in
    activate W
    W->>+D: Look up user
    D-->>-W: Row
    alt found
        W-->>U: Welcome
    else missing
        W--)U: Try again
    end
    deactivate W
    loop every minute
        W->>W: Refresh token
    end
    Note over W,D: Shared cache
    U-xW: Close
